Subject: [PATCH] v2: recover chain state and storage across reorganizations

Extract this concern so its mechanism can be reviewed and measured independently.
No source semantics are added or removed by this history operation.

Original patch rationale (describes the unsplit source, not every extracted part):
Add the libmdbx-backed DiskStateStore for authenticated V2 UTXO state
and flat-file block/undo storage.

Original-Commit: 07d58d9ade1b2187d66f8c83de147d81f6a994b3
Original-Patch: v2/011
Split-Concern: recovery

